OL,3,GNEWSARolls-Royce gas leak prompts
OL,4,Aemergency response
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 300m (985ft) cordon was put into
OL,7,Fplace and locals were asked to remain
OL,8,Findoors with windows and doors shut,
OL,9,Fhowever the guidance was lifted shortly
OL,10,Fbefore 22:00 GMT.
